| 2026-08-19 | R88 correction — إدارة المؤطِّرات | **The teaching profile moved off `المستخدمون` and got its own screen.** It shipped as a row action on the generic account screen, whose population is *every account*: a guardian, a minor and an administrator were each offered a form asking which Subjects they could teach. `/admin/teachers` now sits under الشؤون التعليمية beside `التسجيلات`, so the section holds the people being **taught** and the people **doing the teaching**. **No backend change** — the R88 endpoints, service and dialog are reused unchanged; what moved is ownership. | New rule **AQ** in `ux-architecture.md`: *a screen's population is what decides which operations it may offer*. The population is asked of the server (`role=teacher`), never derived from a fetched page and **never excluding beneficiaries** — R79 made *beneficiary* durable and role-independent precisely so a مؤطِّرة may also study, so `role=teacher` and `beneficiaries_only` are **complements, not variants**. **§14.1 does not list `/admin/teachers`** and the sitemap is authoritative: a one-line addition is the Document Owner's, and the registry guard says so where it was restated. | None |
