| 2026-08-19 | Verified where it could not be read | **11 browser checks**, including the decisive one: after switching to تقويم the **grid's own request** is asserted to carry `branch_id`. A control that still shows a value while the request ignores it is the same defect wearing the fix, and no source reading tells the two apart. | Guarded in `atomic-components.test.tsx` — only the shared hook reads a filter parameter from the URL — and **proven against the defect** with a probe file before being counted as protection. | None |
