ary/{id}/sessions` · `fetchContentSessions` · `UsedInSessions` in the content preview · 7 integration tests covering both gates, the empty answer, unlink, and malformed/unknown ids. **No schema, no SRS, no new relationship.** 1136 backend + 475 frontend tests, 16 CI guards; **live-verified 6/6 against real data** | None |
