ficiency.md` gains a *Reporting is spent from the same budget* section stating the split: **the structure is normative, the length is not, and the length is the whole cost.** **Open for the Document Owner:** adopting the five-section format outright requires an SRS revision to §16.3 — it is available if wanted, but it would trade away the two sections §16.3 pinned on purpose. |
