**A correction to my own earlier enumeration.** While auditing TD-3 I listed
`POST /uploads/{id}/complete`, `/abort` and `PATCH /content/{id}` among the
pending endpoints. They are not: my ad-hoc script compared raw strings while the
guard uses `split(None, 1)`, so a registry line written with two spaces —
